    "body": "## Summary\n- Releasing the mouse after dragging a selection in the diff pane now copies it to the clipboard (OSC 52) immediately — no Ctrl-C needed.\n- A plain click (no drag) still only moves the cursor; the selection stays highlighted after copying and Esc clears it.\n- Ctrl-C still re-copies the selection (or quits when there is none).\n- Help modal entry updated to \"select and copy code text\".\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `cargo test`\n- [ ] Manually drag-select in the diff pane and paste\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)",
